' Target design: CampusMate public attachment APIs authorize chat_id and resolve session_id in Mate Chat Store.
' Target design: CampusMate keeps permanent identity/state and active lifecycle detail in shared openGauss under t_ tables.
' Target design: private OBS stores immutable bodies under Object Key equal to attachment_id; no locator mapping is persisted.
' Target design: agent-service uses internal batch resolve and content streaming, without local files or direct OBS access.
' Design reason: keep public Chat ownership and the file data plane outside Runtime Frames while allowing any service Pod to read authoritative content.

